sequenceDiagram
participant A0 as Scenario
participant A1 as Generated
participant A2 as Audit
participant A3 as Retry
participant A4 as Bearer
participant A5 as Transport
A0->>A1: call generated method with DTO + cancellation
A1->>A2: send HttpRequestMessage through injected HttpClient
A2->>A3: start logical-request timer
A3->>A4: send attempt; only bodyless GET/HEAD can retry
A4->>A4: get cached token or acquire through provider
A4->>A5: attach bearer when configured; send
A5-->>A3: response or transport failure
A3->>A3: bounded retry if eligible; dispose transient response
A3-->>A2: final response
A2-->>A1: record status / elapsed metadata
A1-->>A0: deserialize DTO or throw typed API exception
